     1|/**
     2| * IVX Autonomous Execution — the layer that turns IVX from "verification mode"
     3| * into a self-DRIVING capital business. It runs the REAL sourcing engines on a
     4| * daily cadence and writes their output into the durable CRM + outreach stores
     5| * so work accumulates without a human prompt.
     6| *
     7| * HARD HONESTY RULES (inherited from every engine this composes):
     8| *   - Discovery is REAL: candidates come from `discoverLeads`, which reads public
     9| *     U.S. SEC EDGAR Form D filings. Every record carries a verifiable SEC URL.
    10| *     Nothing is fabricated; unknown fields stay null.
    11| *   - Saving to the CRM is REAL: each promoted lead becomes a durable
    12| *     `InvestorRecord` attributed to its public SEC source (deduped by source URL
    13| *     at discovery time and by identity key at the CRM layer).
    14| *   - Outreach is DRAFTED + QUEUED, never silently "sent". Actual sending requires
    15| *     a configured email provider (none is wired in this deployment), so the
    16| *     capital-outreach engine stages messages for approval and reports
    17| *     `sendingEnabled:false` honestly instead of pretending mail went out.
    18| *   - This module is the SINGLE place the scheduler calls for buyer / investor /
    19| *     JV / outreach execution, so every run is grounded, attributable, and logged.
    20| */
